# Crystal Imperium balance test: Whitney (trainer 406) at the badge-2 level cap (21), where all
# of her Pokemon are since 0.7.0. Team: Pidgeotto / Quilava / Kadabra / Machop (Machop is kept
# for Miltank, holding the first care package's Eviolite), never switching voluntarily. 24
# battles with different RNG must include at least one win and at least two losses. This naive
# team wins about one battle in five (5 of 20 on mGBA, 4 of 20 on VBA-M when measured for 0.7.0;
# without the Eviolite 3 of 12 and 1 of 12), so twelve samples could all be losses by chance.
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!give_mon(17, 21)
!give_mon(156, 21)
!give_mon(64, 21)
!give_mon(66, 21)
!hold_item("ITEM_EVIOLITE", 3)
savestate team.ss
!battle_trainer(406)
wait 1100
expect16 {gBattleMons+136} 35 whitney_leads_clefairy
# Pidgeotto Gust, Quilava Flame Wheel, Kadabra Psybeam, Machop Low Sweep
!sample_battle(406, "0,2,3,0", runs=24, min_wins=1, max_wins=22)
